{"product":{"id":8072492646478,"title":"Lattafa Asad Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three distinctive creations from Lattafa’s Asad collection — a creamy tropical interpretation, a rich tobacco-amber elixir, and a warm cacao-vanilla gourmand. Three miniatures that showcase the bold and versatile character of Asad before going full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAsad Zanzibar\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is black pepper and sea lavender over salty coconut water and iris, settling into vanilla and incense — creamy, tropical, and intriguingly smooth.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAsad Elixir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is pink pepper, saffron, and grapefruit over tobacco, cedarwood, and vanilla, settling into patchouli, olibanum, cashmeran, and dry amber — spicy, rich, and deeply seductive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAsad Bourbon\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is pink pepper, lavender, and mirabelle plum over cacao, davana, and nutmeg, settling into vetiver, bourbon vanilla, and amber — warm, sweet, and irresistibly gourmand.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree Asad signatures, one exceptional set — the perfect way to discover which bold interpretation becomes your next favorite.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-15T14:53:47+05:30","handle":"lattafa-asad-samp